  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_1994.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Las fiestas de Toga llegan a su recta final y&nbsp;este mi&eacute;rcoles&nbsp;ha habido paellas, amenizadas por la Xaranga Ximiraxa. La fiesta del agua ha servido para refrescarse, mientras&nbsp;la Pe&ntilde;a L&#39;Aj&agrave;, que celebra su X aniversario, acababa de preparar la discom&oacute;vil.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1954.jpg\" alt=\"img_1954\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1955.jpg\" alt=\"img_1955\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1956.jpg\" alt=\"img_1956\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1957.jpg\" alt=\"img_1957\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1958.jpg\" alt=\"img_1958\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1959.jpg\" alt=\"img_1959\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1960.jpg\" alt=\"img_1960\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1961.jpg\" alt=\"img_1961\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapaellasfiestastoga13/img_1962.jpg\" alt=\"img_1962\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"http